          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.739,
            0.554,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "12. Why do you push an object closer to scissors fulcrum when you want to cut an object which is hard?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
